{
  "_comment": [
    "Colour mapping for the pre-rendered assets.",
    "",
    "'png' maps an asset directory to the exact ayu colours used by the",
    "rendered PNGs. 'light' applies to files without '-dark' in the name,",
    "'dark' applies to files with '-dark'. The xfwm4 directories are keyed by",
    "their own variant.",
    "",
    "'svg' maps a source SVG/XML file to the exact ayu colours used in the",
    "source artwork, so a re-render reproduces the same result.",
    "",
    "Colours that are pure black/white or flat shadows are intentionally left",
    "untouched - they are masks, not palette colours."
  ],
